  "text": "### Current Account (CURR-001)  \n**Deposit Interest:** £0.00 (no interest on current account balances)  \n**Overdraft Interest (if Arranged):**  \n| Scenario | Rate | Conditions |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Arranged Overdraft** | **15.00% AER** | Pre-approved limit up to £5,000 |\n| **Unarranged Overdraft** | **25.00% AER** | + £5.00 daily fee (not recommended) |  \n**Overdraft Example:**\n```\nArranged overdraft: £1,000\nDaily interest: £1,000 × 15% ÷ 365 = £0.41/day\nMonthly interest: ~£12.50\nAnnual interest: ~£150.00\n```  \n---",
